        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Hereditary Cancer Risk 15-Gene NGS Panel</h2><p><b>Conclusion:</b> A heterozygous pathogenic frameshift variant was identified in the BRCA1 gene in this synthetic sample. No other pathogenic alterations or copy number variants were detected in the remaining 14 genes tested.</p></div>"
